<title>缅甸总统府新闻与传播局发言人10月19日说，内政部两名官员把英国国王查尔斯三世的包裹送到身处首都内比都的昂山素季手中。包</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35716</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35716</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:46:05 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>缅甸总统府新闻与传播局发言人10月19日说，内政部两名官员把英国国王查尔斯三世的包裹送到身处首都内比都的昂山素季手中。包裹里面有两本关于土壤的书，还有一个密封信封和一份密封外交信函。<br/>两本书分别是《土地园丁：从土壤到餐桌》和《土壤：我们脚下的世界》。查尔斯长期倡导环境保护和可持续农业，2017年还是王储时曾在伦敦会晤时任缅甸国务资政的昂山素季。<br/>缅甸的官方声明说，会见持续约10分钟，未透露地点等具体情况。这是缅甸官方时隔两个多月再次发布昂山素季近照。<br/>（<a href="https://apnews.com/article/aung-san-suu-kyi-king-charles-myanmar-98fecc863b744adc4c14d65697cf1304" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>，<a href="https://www.news.cn/20261020/5b7fdc6241884bf28cf3fe9f344004a4/c.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">新华社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/hWGVV7-FdCIaOSg7I5ivtDnmCuOCeKE0CiujiteaAnPVaH8eDs1Xuy-ivSdFpsyPfNgUKa88FG9tkYRSh9SFo0ZFNA6gPc9Ml9UGeW8FFFsgQvnd1GtSH31J3veLRZoYLy-rxCsHDjDFvVFd3aiiSMLViZ0J4NH0xJu3x6K5IdsKZxjxtAR3bGXN8iaJMru29FrsjiFk8rKOTkWyfnSKZDWYCiENUI-VgMHo9FNxVK-19PNrEIwdgVWcE5bMx-fsO785ooPojxTlph1a7jJ8dGsCAQDyxcRQ0Xd8X0qKMa0h5RSG6N7WkgvPPCpSiv4ZtukK5_ZwK1NBQnOCE0e2pA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/YXIYITo2PdvgLtbezLC0yMVGSoBtGtyT1X7vBcVTclW28PiUFFyWsdHl2qn9bhajZj5xgFz0_N3P-Byyb8vkTkS1BNZNKcTinNycIEn7Y1YGX0RgQAteZ8bMwGVSX9YExTmzV5lrRgOXEZ7WivkE_1KuTu3PQSw9iZuq44Ks9uLvNFvBsPga-JmFumPyqCTKT2tNSNXhpfG3JXj0dtjeX47H1-1p2TI3UYe5__J7-Zw57pQKBEi04Q-wTjHvd8iJCsivaueCjOjgLBDD3-EiceVaz6ccHHiTgD2BtBB1FXBGJA7UqSr08hOCqvgm9lKYb9pcwFrKC4yLbC763trF7g.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
