<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35714</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35714</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:30:28 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>法国爆发骚乱后，包括巴黎在内的多个城市实施宵禁。巴黎目前已恢复平静。<br/>在巴黎，宵禁从10月19日23时持续至20日6时。直升机用探照灯检查冲突核心的共和国广场。<br/>在北部里尔，宵禁仅适用于未成年人，警员在市中心巡逻，核查路人身份。<br/>马赛也将从20日晚起针对商业区周边的未成年人实施宵禁。<br/>法国总理表示，针对性的宵禁措施有助于维持19日晚巴黎的平静，根据需要，宵禁可能会延长。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/targeted-curfews-helped-keep-peace-overnight-france-pm-says-2026-10-20/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/france-protests-violence-curfew-paris-looting-13189fcb1481614dc65c2125deb8333d" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/D5y-06DZ665lzX4HaqWVEydMSXn_QQJEDLgM-Bzvnbv-qUc4sJI26sYjQ19mjhmgTwBZkn9EsD8YsGobgxzxuVWicCZw9fxmGFzcxkpEVrfMIA9iosfXYLUn2FPGNCAx2knt2ZEOzTjmEZybybjNyUTkOm4x6nevigcxhhewpGW_San5zlyNKAzwEAOzMWvcu_BNoXnzyhYAWfQx3Jys9cCkZep6E9Lqz3eQIEL-z43rt7lrtWSkNBnT3TOr7ycbjPMKTHGhlKJpALYO1Pu0S2LGlKhkGNEBp5rRRDnhDwmcR1JET7GBCxy65do61J1emMa8BsNd4bGpQoGEIwDceQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
